OL,3,GNEWSAArmed phone thief on e-bike
OL,4,Atracked by drone jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA thief armed with a machete who was
OL,7,Ftracked down by a police drone after
OL,8,Fsnatching phones as he sped through
OL,9,Fcentral London on an e-bike has been
OL,10,Fsentenced.
OL,12,FWesley Rodrigues, 18, was arrested
OL,13,Fwithin 15 minutes of being identified
OL,14,Fvia the drone, which tracked and
OL,15,Ffollowed him through the streets.
OL,17,FVideo captured him stealing a phone
OL,18,Fbefore being pursued by a police
OL,19,Fofficer on a motorbike, knocked off his
OL,20,Fbike, chased, and tripped up by a
OL,21,Fpasser-by.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
