OL,3,GNEWSAArmed phone thief on e-bike
OL,4,Atracked by drone jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FRodrigues, from Walthamstow, was
OL,7,Fsentenced at Southwark Crown Court to
OL,8,F18 months' detention in a young
OL,9,Foffender institution after pleading
OL,10,Fguilty to six counts of theft,
OL,11,Fdangerous driving, possession of an
OL,12,Foffensive weapon and not having
OL,13,Finsurance.
